# Custom Icons Configuration for HyprLTM-Net
# Copy this file to ~/.config/hyprltm/hyprltm-net.conf and edit exactly the variables you want to change.
# Any uncommented line will override the default behavior in the picker menu.
# NOTE: The default symbols below belong to JetBrains Nerd Fonts. Ensure the new characters exist in the font family you use.

